        "note": "09:40–09:55 | 15s\n中文提示：左码是本次新版PPT，右码是申报材料。留下邮箱，欢迎来深圳，感谢。\n\nEnglish speaking script:\nThese two codes link to this presentation and our submission materials. My email is on the screen. Please stay in touch, and come to Shenzhen. Thank you.\n\n[Sources]\nPresenter-supplied contact: tony@cocorobo.cc. QR destinations: https://tonyxinvip.github.io/slides/teacher-agent-creators-10min/ and https://cocorobo.hk/unesco2026/teacher/. QR codes encode these exact URLs; they are not third-party tracking links."
